cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MemBack in your research, please cite the preprint below."
title: "MemBack"
abstract: >-
  Neural backmapping of coarse-grained Martini 3 membranes to all-atom CHARMM36
  structures using an SE(3)-equivariant graph neural network, with automated
  hydrogen placement, solvent and ion conversion, stereochemical correction and
  clash resolution.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/BioMemPhys-FAU/memback"
version: "0.1.1"
keywords:
  - backmapping
  - coarse-grained
  - molecular-dynamics
  - martini
  - graph-neural-network
  - lipid-membranes

